<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF MEN'S COMBINED EVENT.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF MEN'S COMBINED EVENT.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
